# Documentation sources of truth

Start from [`docs/README.md`](docs/README.md). Read `roadmap.md` **Now**
before starting a feature, picking next work, or claiming something is
done. Design: `docs/principles.md`.

| File | Owns | Must not become |
|------|------|-----------------|
| `roadmap.md` | Scheduled work (Now, phases, vis-*, landed) | Bug narrative; long how-to |
| `issues.md` | Honesty leftovers (Associated id) | Copy of `R*` |
| `docs/tech-issues.md` | Landed-correctness `R*` / `ti-*` | Honesty menu policy |
| `backlog.md` | Unassigned ideas | The Now queue |
| `docs/coverage.md` | Feature × manual status | Phase schedule |
| `docs/visual-fidelity-inventory.md` | LCD element audit | Full coverage table |
| `docs/principles.md` | Design rules | Task list |
| `README.md` | How to run; Status → **Now** | Duplicate roadmap |
| `AGENTS.md` / `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` | Agent gates | Competing Now |
| `docs/prompts/<id>.md` | One-slice / pairing kickoff | Second roadmap |
| `docs/prompts/supervisor.md` | Oversight + short snapshot | Implementation |
| `docs/prompts/validate-unit.md` | Pairing cadence + G tables | Queue |
| `docs/prompts/validate-status.md` | Pairing cursor | Queue |

- Update the **owning** `.md` when you add, finish, defer, or close work.
- **Canvases:** optional. Do **not** refresh on pairing/resolve/setup
  handoffs. Only if Ron asks or verify-docs says so. See
  `canvases/README.md`.
- Naming: never name the hardware vendor or original model.
- Supervisor chats: `docs/prompts/supervisor.md` — no leftover impl.
- Full audit: `.cursor/skills/verify-docs/SKILL.md`.
- Do not recreate a task list in the README, a canvas, or chat.
